sta correção entra primeiro em `release/1.8.0`; a RC1 permanece imutável e a RC2 será criada somente depois do merge, com novos avais.\n\n## Validação\n\nFlutter analyze e Flutter test passaram localmente. O check obrigatório também executa os testes da esteira no GitHub antes do merge.\n\nEste PR faz parte do ensaio autorizado de recusar a RC1 e corrigir a entrega. A promoção cria uma tag estável e uma Release no GitHub; distribuição mobile permanece fora deste ensaio.\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T01:51:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T01:56:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4dd735fe321361fbe5db313943ff675fe5cd8d27","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/20/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/20/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/issues/20/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/statuses/2e9e929580e888bbf2075b0460606a97f27d8771","head":{"label":"israelhudson:codex/slack-rc2-correction","ref":"codex/slack-rc2-correction","sha":"2e9e929580e888bbf2075b0460606a97f27d8771","user":{"login":"israelhudson","id":18661493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjYxNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18661493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson","html_url":"https://github.com/israelhudson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/sta